{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 113, :comments ["<b>סעפים</b> — a descriptor, like 'those of divided thoughts,' as in: 'לכן שעיפי ישיבוני' (Isaiah 29:24). Or from the stem of מסעף פארה, and the descriptor is derived, like: 'ושבח אני את המתים'; and the meaning is 'those who corrupt.'"], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 119, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:40:44.780381620Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}